#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Expo"
msgstr "工作区总览"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid "A plugin to show an overview of all workspaces."
msgstr "显示所有工作区概览的插件。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Toggle"
msgstr "切换"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Shows an overview of all workspaces with the specified activator. Pressing "
"again exits."
msgstr "使用指定激活器显示所有工作区的概览。再次按下可退出。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Background color"
msgstr "背景颜色"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Sets the background color."
msgstr "设置背景颜色。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Zoom duration"
msgstr "缩放持续时间"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Sets the zoom duration in milliseconds."
msgstr "设置缩放持续时间（毫秒）。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Delimiter offset"
msgstr "分隔线偏移"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Sets the delimiter offset (in pixels) between workspaces."
msgstr "设置工作区之间的分隔线偏移（像素）。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Keyboard interaction"
msgstr "键盘交互"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Allow the use of arrow keys to select a workspace, ESC to cancel and ENTER "
"to accept."
msgstr "允许使用方向键选择工作区，ESC 取消，ENTER 确认。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Brightness of inactive workspaces"
msgstr "非活动工作区亮度"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Decrease the brightness of all workspaces except the currently selected one "
"to this value."
msgstr "将除当前选中工作区外的所有工作区亮度降低到此值。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Brightness transition duration"
msgstr "亮度过渡持续时间"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Duration of the transition of brightness when a new workspace is selected in "
"milliseconds."
msgstr "选中新工作区时亮度过渡的持续时间（毫秒）。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Select workspace"
msgstr "选择工作区"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"When the binding is triggered while expo is active, the corresponding "
"workspace will be focused and Expo will exit."
msgstr "当 Expo 处于活动状态时触发此绑定，将聚焦对应的工作区并退出 Expo。"
